----------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code
----------------------------------------------------------------------

RecoverD bundles no third-party source or binary dependencies. It links only against Apple system
frameworks (Foundation, SwiftUI, AppKit, AVFoundation, ImageIO, PDFKit, IOKit, DiskArbitration)
and uses the macOS system tool `authopen` for authorized device access.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
Acknowledgements
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The file-system parsers and signature carver are implemented from public format documentation
(Microsoft exFAT/FAT specifications, the ISO base media file format, Matroska/EBML, TIFF, and
published camera-RAW and container layouts). No third-party measurement data, sample files, or
proprietary code are redistributed.

Planned: an APFS bridge via libfsapfs (https://github.com/libyal/libfsapfs, GNU LGPL v3+). It is
not yet integrated; this notice will be updated when it is.
